Description: GUI controller for yabridge — manage Windows VST/VST3 plugins on Linux
 A GUI controller for yabridge that provides a plugin browser, one-click sync,
 Pro Audio Setup Assistant, guided remediation, a free plugin browser, and
 diagnostic reports for troubleshooting.
